# Environment. `.env` was tracked until 2026-07-27 — see .env.example for the
# shape. Vite exposes every VITE_-prefixed var to the browser, so a
# server-only secret (service_role key, payment gateway key) must never live
# in this file at all, ignored or not.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

